        text: "You don't need to cover a thousand SKUs on day one. Start with your bestsellers — the products that drive most of your revenue — and the five questions shoppers ask about them most. Measure two things: how many conversations end at checkout, and how many abandoned carts get recovered. Expand the catalog coverage from there. Behind the scenes, tools like [n8n workflow automation](/blog/n8n-workflow-automation-small-business) can connect the assistant to your stock system so it never recommends something you cannot ship.",
